    "name": "implementing-log-forwarding-with-fluentd",
    "description": "Configures Fluent Bit as an endpoint log forwarder and Fluentd as the central aggregator for centralized log collection, routing, filtering, and enrichment, covering input plugins for syslog/file-tailing/application logs and output routing to Elasticsearch, S3, and Splunk. Use when setting up centralized log aggregation across distributed infrastructure or generating Fluent Bit/Fluentd configuration files for a new log pipeline.",
